# Metropolis Neon, east half (C4a, contract 39), 34 x 23. column = i, row = j. Ruta 7 arrives at the EAST edge (i = 33, rows 12..13); the avenue (asphalt, rows 12..13) runs west to the other half
# (`metropolis_neon_2`, the west edge i = 0). Look (the user's mock "Metropolis Neon"): a CYBERPUNK city: dark neon BLOCKS with lit windows and big blinking signs, animated HOLO billboards, parked cars, street lamps, asphalt
# avenue with dashed lanes, light sidewalks. Centro (door c), the CENTRO COMERCIAL (department store: a block with a door, `comercial_1`), the FAN CLUB (a block with a door). Three townsfolk.
@map metropolis_neon
@size 34 23
@interior no
@area metropolis_neon
@fly 6 metropolis_neon 26 8 face=S   # the Planeador lands here, in front of the Centro door; slot 6 = visited flag 990 (contract 46.1)
@bg 0
@fill sidewalk
@spawn east 32 12 W
@spawn west 1 12 E
@spawn centro_door 26 8 S
@spawn dept_door 11 8 S
@spawn club_door 27 20 S
@legend
  .  tile=sidewalk
  a  object=chain_i
  b  object=chain_j
  c  object=nblock_1
  d  object=nblock_0
  e  object=center_f
  f  door=nblock_0
  g  door=center_f
  h  object=sign text=neon.mall.sign interact=look
  i  npc=mama id=npc_b face=SW text=neon.npc.b
  j  object=sign text=neon.centro.sign interact=look
  k  object=lamp_s
  l  object=road_sign text=neon.sign.a interact=look
  m  object=holo text=neon.holo.a interact=look
  n  tile=asph
  o  tile=asph
  p  tile=asph
  q  object=sign text=neon.holo.b interact=look
  r  object=car
  s  npc=vecino_m id=npc_a face=NE script=hint_neon
  t  npc=vecino_m id=npc_c face=W text=neon.npc.c
  u  door=nblock_1
  v  object=sign text=neon.club.sign interact=look
  w  tile=sidewalk item=disc_42
  H  tile=sidewalk hidden=pp_extra   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  bwccddccdd..ddccddccddcc..ccddcc.b
  b.ccddccdd..ddccddccddcc..ccddcc.b
  b................................b
  b................................b
  b................cc..............b
  b...cc....dd.....cc......eee.....b
  b...cc....df........dd...ege.....b
  b...................dd...........b
  b................................b
  b..........h..i..........j.......b
  b.......k......k.l....k.......km.b
  noooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooop
  noooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooop
  b.q...k......k..r...k...k........b
  b...............r.....s..........b
  b.............................t..b
  b...dd......cc...................b
  b...dd......cc....dd......cc.....b
  b.................dd......cu.....b
  b.......................v........b
  b........H.......................b
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
@warp f -> comercial_1 spawn=door
@warp g -> centro_neon spawn=door
@warp n -> metropolis_neon_2 spawn=east
@warp p -> ruta_7 spawn=west
@warp u -> club_fans spawn=door
# D1 (contract 68): a clue of the hidden Gruta del Eclipse (when the stone shows).
@script hint_neon npc
    npc_face_hero npc_a
    say neon.npc.a
    say d1.hint.neon
@end
